# Ultron, Artificial Malevolence: "Whenever another nontoken artifact you control enters, you may pay {2}. If you do, create a token
# that's a copy of it. If the token isn't a creature, it becomes a 2/2 Robot Villain creature in addition to its other types."
# Three Moxen pay for Ultron; Mox Ruby then enters, and Black Lotus's mana pays the {2}. The token is a Mox Ruby that is also a
# 2/2 Robot Villain creature. The token's own entering does not trigger Ultron (it is a token): there is exactly one token.

